From 279a980a085f692abf125e4d405b6ea88c422954 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scada <scada@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:16:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/78] arm64: configs: joan_defconfig: build the joan drivers
 in, firmware loaders as modules

All joan drivers are built in except those that request firmware at
probe (remoteprocs, Venus, IPA, the Bluetooth UART): /vendor/firmware is
only mounted later on Android, so init loads those as modules. Drop NFS,
KVM, PCI and MTD to keep the image well below what LG's ABL loads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0144VMKxYe33NKa3LLPZNivr
